stateDiagram-v2
    state "SemanticCleanup<br/>join/drain/Service::OnConnectionClose" as SemanticCleanup
    [*] --> Accepted
    Accepted --> Setup: 创建 Connection Fiber
    Setup --> ProtocolFlow: TLS/HTTP/RESP/Memcache 分流
    ProtocolFlow --> WaitingInput: 初始化 context/parser/replier
    WaitingInput --> Parsing: socket data
    Parsing --> Dispatching: 完整命令
    Dispatching --> ShardExecution: transactional command
    ShardExecution --> Replying: hop 完成
    Dispatching --> Replying: connection-only command
    Replying --> Parsing: buffer 仍有命令
    Replying --> WaitingInput: 当前批次结束
    WaitingInput --> Closing: EOF/error/shutdown
    Parsing --> Closing: protocol error
    Dispatching --> Closing: QUIT/marked close
    Closing --> SemanticCleanup
    SemanticCleanup --> SocketClose: listener shutdown + close
    SocketClose --> Unlinked: intrusive list unlink
    Unlinked --> Destroyed: intrusive refcount = 0
    Destroyed --> [*]
